    "result_text": "All 257 tests pass. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `membershipNumber` assignment for owners, formatted `<customerCode>-M<YY>` where `YY` is the last two digits of the registration date year.\n\nChanges made, following the existing pattern for the other derived owner fields (`customerCode`, `householdId`, `namesakeCount`):\n\n1. **`model/Owner.java`** \u2014 added a `membershipNumber` field (mapped to a `membership_number` column) with getter/setter.\n\n2. **`rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java`** \u2014 in `addOwner`, after `registrationDate` and `customerCode` are assigned, set the membership number via a new `membershipNumber(...)` helper: `String.format(\"%s-M%02d\", customerCode, registrationDate.getYear() % 100)`.\n\n3. **`resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `membershipNumber` property to the `Owner` schema so it appears in the generated `OwnerDto` and is auto-mapped by MapStruct (by name) into the GET response.\n\n4. **DB schemas** (`h2`, `hsqldb`, `mysql`, `postgres`) \u2014 added the `membership_number` column to the `owners` table.\n\nThe new `AcceptanceTest.coreMembershipNumberFormat` passes, and the full suite is green (257 tests, 0 failures).",
